# Sequences for the af3lis smoke test (examples/smoke.tsv).
# Shipped rather than fetched so the smoke test is deterministic and
# works offline -- a UniProt outage should not break your
# does-my-cluster-work test. SUMO2 is deliberately LEFT OUT and given
# as a bare accession in smoke.tsv, so the UniProt fetch path is still
# exercised on every smoke run.
